			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">On December 7, 2023, our Board of Directors, on recommendation of the Compensation and Management Committee, granted to Mr. Fain the option to purchase 18,400 shares of our common stock. This option vested with respect to 6,134 shares on December 7, 2024 and 6,133 shares on December 7, 2025, and will vest with respect to 6,133 shares on December 7, 2026.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px;">

